<title>USA: Fusion Medical names Anderson CFO.</title>
<headline>Fusion Medical names Anderson CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fusion Medical Technologies Inc named Raymond Anderson as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>A spokesman could not immediately say who Anderson replaced as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>In 1981, Anderson joined Syntex Laboratories, the domestic pharmaceutical division of Syntex, as director of financial planning and analysis and later became controller of the division.</p>
